title: "TMCRA: Temporal Memory-Centric Retrieval Architecture"
version: 0.3.0-rc2
abstract: >-
  A full-stack personal memory system with a layered memory graph,
  evidence-backed recall, actor provenance, on-device voiceprint attribution,
  and a production HTTP control plane.
